#: ../../.opencode/skills/spec-sizing/SKILL.md:65
msgid "Why this shape (Option C)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/spec-sizing/SKILL.md:67
msgid ""
"Shared vocabulary, absolute magnitude, per-type bands layered on top. A "
"`giant feature` ≈ a `small initiative` in absolute effort — so promotion "
"is literally \"move one step up the type ladder.\" One mental model, one "
"promotion rule. Don't re-litigate this choice; the spec rejected the "
"alternatives explicitly."
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/spec-sizing/SKILL.md:73
msgid "Nudge intensity by tier and moment"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/spec-sizing/SKILL.md:75
msgid ""
"Even `giant` is **advisory**. Friction climbs but the user always wins. "
"Never block delivery; record the user's choice and proceed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/spec-sizing/SKILL.md
msgid "Design-time"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/spec-sizing/SKILL.md
msgid "On scope-up edit"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/spec-sizing/SKILL.md
msgid "Mid-delivery"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/spec-sizing/SKILL.md
msgid "soft ask once"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/spec-sizing/SKILL.md
msgid "quiet"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/spec-sizing/SKILL.md
msgid "mention in handoff"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/spec-sizing/SKILL.md
msgid "strong ask; recommend `/compose` or `/split`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/spec-sizing/SKILL.md
msgid "re-ask if scope grew"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/spec-sizing/SKILL.md
